# {{ .vars.project_name }}

{{ .vars.description | default "A production-ready microservices monorepo built with Go." }}

## Features

- **Microservices Architecture**: Independent, scalable services
- **Shared Libraries**: Common code for consistency
- **Infrastructure as Code**: Terraform modules for AWS
- **Kubernetes Ready**: Helm charts and Kustomize overlays
- **CI/CD Pipelines**: GitHub Actions and GitLab CI
- **Full Observability**: Metrics, logging, and tracing

## Services

| Service | Description | Port |
|---------|-------------|------|
| auth-service | Authentication and authorization | 8081 |
| user-service | User management | 8082 |
| order-service | Order processing | 8083 |
| payment-service | Payment processing | 8084 |

## Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Go {{ .vars.go_version | default "1.22" }}+
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Make

### Development

```bash
# Set up development environment
./scripts/setup-dev.sh

# Start all services
make dev

# Run tests
make test

# Build all binaries
make build
```

### Using Docker Compose

```bash
# Start infrastructure
docker-compose up -d postgres redis kafka

# Build and start services
docker-compose up -d --build
```

